{
  "name": "Kualat: Daily top links to Slack",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Daily top links to Slack\n\nEvery morning the workflow lists the kua.lat links with the most clicks and posts them to a Slack channel.\n\n**Set up:**\n1. Install the **@kualat/n8n-nodes-kualat** community node under Settings → Community Nodes.\n2. Create a **Kualat API** credential (API URL, for example `https://kua.lat/api`, and an API key).\n3. Connect a Slack credential (bot token with `chat:write`) and set the target channel on the **Post to Slack** node.\n4. Adjust the posting hour in the **Every morning** node if 9:00 does not suit you (uses the workflow timezone).\n5. Activate the workflow.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 440
      },
      "id": "f6000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "How to use",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-480, -160]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 9 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "f6000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Every morning",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [0, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "link",
        "operation": "getAll",
        "returnAll": false,
        "limit": 5,
        "filters": {
          "order": "click"
        }
      },
      "id": "f6000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Get Top Links",
      "type": "@kualat/n8n-nodes-kualat.kualat",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [260, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const links = $input.all().map((item) => item.json);\n\nif (links.length === 0) {\n  return [{ json: { lines: 'No links on the account yet.' } }];\n}\n\nconst lines = links\n  .map((link, index) => `${index + 1}. <${link.short_url}|${link.alias || link.short_url}> — ${link.clicks ?? 0} clicks → ${link.long_url}`)\n  .join('\\n');\n\nreturn [{ json: { count: links.length, lines } }];"
      },
      "id": "f6000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Format Top List",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [520, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "post",
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "#marketing",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "text": "=*Top kua.lat links by clicks*\n\n{{ $json.lines }}",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "id": "f6000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Post to Slack",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [780, 0]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Every morning": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Get Top Links",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Get Top Links": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Format Top List",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Format Top List": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Post to Slack",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {},
  "pinData": {}
}
